# WordPress Quick Reference

## Text Domain & Prefix
- Text domain: `'skel'`
- Function prefix: `skel_`

## Template Hierarchy
```
Front Page:   front-page.php → home.php → index.php
Single Post:  single-{post-type}.php → single.php → index.php
Page:         page-{slug}.php → page.php → index.php
Archive:      archive-{post-type}.php → archive.php → index.php
```

## Common Hooks
```php
add_action( 'after_setup_theme', 'skel_setup' );
add_action( 'wp_enqueue_scripts', 'skel_enqueue_scripts' );
add_filter( 'body_class', 'skel_body_classes' );
add_filter( 'excerpt_length', 'skel_excerpt_length' );
```

## Data Attributes
- `data-inview` - Viewport animation trigger
- `data-toggle-click` - Toggle on click
- `data-toggle-group` - Group toggle elements
- `data-aos` - Animation type
